[16:54:22,338][INFO][sys-#136][GridDhtPartitionsExchangeFuture] Coordinator received single message [ver=AffinityTopologyVersion [topVer=13, minorTopVer=0], node=2b69b32f-1bea-4c83-a70d-d7ff8ad7e319, allReceived=false]
[16:54:22,401][INFO][sys-#137][GridDhtPartitionsExchangeFuture] Coordinator received single message [ver=AffinityTopologyVersion [topVer=13, minorTopVer=0], node=933628df-5237-435c-81d3-7d4be20d8cea, allReceived=false]
