[16:54:26,443][INFO][db-checkpoint-thread-#86][GridCacheDatabaseSharedManager] Skipping checkpoint (no pages were modified) [checkpointLockWait=8ms, checkpointLockHoldTime=776ms, reason=&apos;timeout&apos;]
