&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This method is invoked two times:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;GridDhtPartitionsExchangeFuture#finishExchangeOnCoordinator()&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;GridDhtPartitionsExchangeFuture#onDone()&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Do we really need to perform Detecting lost partitions twice?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
