                            <comment id="16683539" author="antonovsergey93" created="Mon, 12 Nov 2018 10:37:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sboikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sboikov&quot;&gt;sboikov&lt;/a&gt;, could we know your opinion?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16684285" author="sboikov" created="Mon, 12 Nov 2018 19:29:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=antonovsergey93&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;antonovsergey93&quot;&gt;antonovsergey93&lt;/a&gt;, yes, looks like for coordinator second call in GridDhtPartitionsExchangeFuture#onDone() can be removed. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16812422" author="ignitetcbot" created="Mon, 8 Apr 2019 13:22:49 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #F7D6C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: Possible Blockers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d04437&quot;&gt;Scala (Visor Console)&lt;/font&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3539309]&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;[tests 0 Exit Code &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3539388&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16812430" author="denis chudov" created="Mon, 8 Apr 2019 13:34:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sboikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sboikov&quot;&gt;sboikov&lt;/a&gt;, i did some investigation and it seems we can not simply remove Detect lost partitions call neither from onDone, nor from&#160;finishExchangeOnCoordinator as it causes multiple test failures. For now, i added a flag into&#160;GridDhtPartitionsExchangeFuture, which doesn&apos;t allow duplicate detectLostPartitions call in same future instance again. Will it be acceptable solution?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16874035" author="ignitetcbot" created="Thu, 27 Jun 2019 11:52:15 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=4206290&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16874269" author="denis chudov" created="Thu, 27 Jun 2019 15:52:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivan.glukos&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivan.glukos&quot;&gt;ivan.glukos&lt;/a&gt;, could you review my fix, please?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16877305" author="ivan.glukos" created="Tue, 2 Jul 2019 21:17:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Denis+Chudov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Denis Chudov&quot;&gt;Denis Chudov&lt;/a&gt;, we can just do &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
crd.isLocal()
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;instead of more complex&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
U.isLocalNodeCoordinator(cctx.discovery())
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16878431" author="denis chudov" created="Thu, 4 Jul 2019 08:27:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivan.glukos&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivan.glukos&quot;&gt;ivan.glukos&lt;/a&gt;, fixed&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16878615" author="nsamelchev" created="Thu, 4 Jul 2019 12:32:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Denis+Chudov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Denis Chudov&quot;&gt;Denis Chudov&lt;/a&gt;, Hi!&lt;br/&gt;
Can crd be null here if all servers left?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16879277" author="ivan.glukos" created="Fri, 5 Jul 2019 13:49:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=NSAmelchev&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;NSAmelchev&quot;&gt;NSAmelchev&lt;/a&gt;, I agree, crd may be null.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Denis+Chudov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Denis Chudov&quot;&gt;Denis Chudov&lt;/a&gt;, I&apos;ve merged PR to master with suggested null check.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
